  "execution": "Flash GPU expert caches now compose with joint cohort FFN kernels. An exclusive owner-issued layer lease pins the selected union across up to16 bound requests. All consumers retain private routing/precision and attention/recurrent state. Source banks upload each miss once; joint kernels use a mixed cached/raw device-pointer table.",
